iBabe is the most dynamically developing social network in the world. Online dating is the most popular way of dating for today. Millions of guys and girls are waiting for you at iBabe. Meet in one click now.

Every love story is beautiful, but yours will be perfect!

Why we are better.
We combined 5 applications in one: the full functionality of the messenger, the most popular features in dating, enabled users to see who nearby, made it possible for users to create and administer their thematic group for business, created a loyalty program in which you can easily earn if you invite friends.

What can the messenger do:
- write messages;
- security - you do not need to exchange a phone number for a chat or a call;
- send and receive any types of files;
- send and receive video up to 100 mb;
- send and receive contacts from the address book;
- send and receive user's geolocation;
- accept and send funny gifts in the chat;
- send friends invitations to the chat and loyalty program;
- it is possible to transfer coins from one user to another;
- there is an opportunity to call the user you like via the application;
- it is possible to make a video call;
- all chat conversations are encrypted with a 15360-bit key.

What features of the application you will see in the dating:
- the opportunity to get acquainted with all users of the social network iBabe;
- you can write or call any user without any preliminary "likes";
- find the user by filters: gender, age, city;
- shake the phone and see which users are next to you;
- take advantage of the tape of acquaintances and you will see millions of users of the social network iBabe;
- raise your profile in the general search, get love and respect;

How the Who's Nearby function works
- Shake the phone, and the application will show on the screen smartphone avatars users with the name, age and distance from you;
- Start a chat with a girl or boy next to you.

What is my group and how to use it.
- in our social network each user can to start his own thematic group for business (analog VK, WeChat)
- create your own group, upload pictures of the goods and start receiving orders;
- there are not enough customers, raise your group in search;
- communicate in the general chat group with customers;
- create a private chat with any user;
- send to the chat photos, videos or any files not more than 100 mb;
- call through iBabe to any user;
- accept payment by internal currency for the goods inside the application;
- search for groups by name, keyword or hashtag;

We also took care of user usability:
- convenient registration from any country of the world (definition of the code, substitution of coordinates instead of the name of the city);
- language support for 7 languages ​​(automatic);
- Intuitive user profile;
- push notification of events in the application (and for Chinese users);
- encryption of the phone's address book;
- convenient search filter for users of social network  iBabe (gender, age, city);
- convenient ranking of profiles in the search (new profiles are always on top);
- the function "who near" works simply from shaking the phone;
- search in groups by keyword or hashtag;
- convenient ranking of groups in the search (for more subscribers);
- the ability to select the notification sound from the 21st version;
- ability to set any background of chats from the phone's gallery;
- Internal currency in the application, with the opportunity to replenish the account;
- the ability to transfer coins to another user and cash them;
- burglary-resistant RS message encryption;
- ability to set a password to enter the application;
